<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58116" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνέφαλλον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wool torn off</i> in carding or
			fulling cloth, <i>flock</i>, used for stuffing cushions or
			pillows: hence, <i>cushion, pillow</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				676
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				228
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				19
			</span></i>, etc. (prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.330.22
			</span></i>, cf. Demioprat. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				10.39
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάφαλλον, γνάφαλλον</span>
			(cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνάπτω, γνάπτω</span>) are freq. as
			vv.ll.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνάφαλλα</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				298
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				Aeol.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γνόφαλλον</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				34.6
			</span></i>.</div>
